//! Release acceptance for the immutable official FLAN-T5-small checkpoint.
//!
//! The tests never contact a model hub.  The reference bundle is generated by
//! `scripts/generate_flan_t5_small_reference.py` through the pinned official
//! Transformers implementation.  It authenticates full F32 vocabulary vectors
//! for stateless, cached, teacher-forced, right-padded, and 512-token source
//! paths; tokenization, 32 greedy decisions, and four-beam generation are also
//! checked end to end.
//!
//! ```text
//! TRANSFORMERS_FLAN_T5_SMALL_DIR=/path/to/checkpoint \
//! TRANSFORMERS_FLAN_T5_SMALL_REFERENCE_DIR=/path/to/reference.bundle \
//! cargo test --release --no-default-features --features std,flex,tokenizers \
//!   --test flan_t5_small flan_t5_small_flex_matches_official_reference \
//!   -- --ignored --exact --nocapture --test-threads=1
//! ```

